### ConceptQuery API walkthrough
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request" above each block.
### Order: register -> verify (link is printed in the server log) -> login -> the rest.

@api = http://localhost:4000/api
@email = 1ms24ci080@msrit.edu
@password = demo-pass-123
# Paste the accessToken from the login response here:
@token = paste-access-token

### Health: database, embedding model, configured language model providers
GET {{api}}/health

### Register (only @msrit.edu addresses are accepted)
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Demo Student", "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login: returns an access token; the refresh token arrives as an httpOnly cookie
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rotate the refresh token (uses the cookie from login)
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh

### Upload a paper (needs the uploader or moderator role: npm run user:role -w server -- <email> moderator)
POST {{api}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="kind"

question_paper
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="paper.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../samples/papers/01-SEE-2023-Design_and_Analysis_of_Algorithms.pdf
--b--

### Documents and their processing status
GET {{api}}/documents?limit=20

### Hybrid search (keyword BM25 + vector, fused with reciprocal rank fusion)
GET {{api}}/search?q=shortest path from a single source

### Filters parsed from plain English: course acronym, marks, year
GET {{api}}/search?q=DAA greedy algorithms 2023

### Compare modes on the same query
GET {{api}}/search?q=using a stack to rewrite arithmetic expressions&mode=keyword
###
GET {{api}}/search?q=using a stack to rewrite arithmetic expressions&mode=vector

### Analytics: most-examined topics, distribution by year, questions asked again
GET {{api}}/analytics/topics?limit=15
###
GET {{api}}/analytics/distribution?by=year
###
GET {{api}}/analytics/recurring
###
GET {{api}}/analytics/stats

### Moderation queue (moderator)
GET {{api}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Topic vocabulary
GET {{api}}/topics
